<main id="main">
<section class="pagehead">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="pagehead-inner">
      <span class="eyebrow">Contact</span>
      <h1>Reach us however is safest.</h1>
      <div class="lede"><p>You do not have to give your real name. You do not have to explain everything. Tell us how to reply to you safely and we will follow that exactly.</p></div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section-lg">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="grid g-2" style="gap:3rem;align-items:start">

      <div>
        <span class="eyebrow">Write to us</span>
        <h2 class="display-caps">A private message.</h2>

        <div class="safety-note" style="margin:1.25rem 0 1.75rem">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M12 9v4"/><path d="M12 17h.01"/><path d="M10.3 3.9 1.8 18a2 2 0 0 0 1.7 3h17a2 2 0 0 0 1.7-3L13.7 3.9a2 2 0 0 0-3.4 0Z"/></svg>          <div><p><strong>Before you send:</strong> tell us how and when it is safe to reply to you. If it is not safe for us to call or email, say so and we will only message on WhatsApp — or not at all until you contact us again.</p></div>
        </div>

        <form class="form" data-safe-form autocomplete="off" novalidate>
          <div class="field">
            <label for="f-name">Name <span class="label-opt">(optional)</span></label>
            <span class="hint">A first name, an initial, or nothing at all.</span>
            <input id="f-name" name="name" type="text" autocomplete="off" spellcheck="false">
          </div>
          <div class="field">
            <label for="f-method">Preferred contact method</label>
            <select id="f-method" name="method">
              <option value="">Choose one</option>
              <option>WhatsApp only</option>
              <option>SMS only</option>
              <option>Phone call</option>
              <option>Email</option>
              <option>Do not contact me — I will contact you again</option>
            </select>
          </div>
          <div class="field">
            <label for="f-contact">Where to reach you <span class="label-opt">(optional)</span></label>
            <span class="hint">Leave blank if you would rather contact us again yourself.</span>
            <input id="f-contact" name="contact" type="text" autocomplete="off" spellcheck="false">
          </div>
          <div class="field">
            <label for="f-times">Safe times to contact you</label>
            <span class="hint">For example: weekday mornings, or only between 9am and 11am.</span>
            <input id="f-times" name="safe_times" type="text" autocomplete="off">
          </div>
          <div class="field">
            <label for="f-message">Your message</label>
            <span class="hint">Share as much or as little as you want. You do not need proof and you do not need a plan.</span>
            <textarea id="f-message" name="message" required></textarea>
          </div>
          <div class="btn-row">
            <button type="submit" class="btn btn-primary">Send message</button>
            <button type="reset" class="btn btn-ghost">Clear this form</button>
          </div>
        </form>

        <p class="form-status" data-form-status hidden></p>
        <p class="small muted mt-2">This form is text only. We do not send an automatic confirmation email, so nothing from us arrives in your inbox unless you asked us to email you. Anything you type here is cleared from the page if you switch away or close the tab.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="stack">
        <div class="callout">
          <h4>Helpline</h4>
          <p><a class="val-lg" href="tel:+000000000000">[XXX-XXX-XXXX]</a><br>Available [hours]</p>
          <p class="mb-0"><strong>WhatsApp:</strong> <a href="https://wa.me/000000000000" rel="noreferrer noopener">[XXX-XXX-XXXX]</a><br>
          <strong>SMS:</strong> <a href="sms:+000000000000">[XXX-XXX-XXXX]</a></p>
        </div>
        <div class="callout">
          <h4>Office</h4>
          <p class="mb-0">[Address]<br>[Opening hours]</p>
        </div>
        <div class="callout">
          <h4>General enquiries</h4>
          <p class="mb-0"><a href="mailto:[address]">[address]</a></p>
        </div>
        <div class="callout" id="media">
          <h4>Media enquiries</h4>
          <p><a href="mailto:[address]">[address]</a></p>
          <div class="mb-0"><p><strong>We do not connect journalists directly to survivors under any circumstances.</strong></p></div>
        </div>
        <div class="callout">
          <h4>Volunteering, partnership and fundraising</h4>
          <p class="mb-0">Use the form, and say which one in your message. <a href="/get-involved">What we need</a>.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="safety-note"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M12 9v4"/><path d="M12 17h.01"/><path d="M10.3 3.9 1.8 18a2 2 0 0 0 1.7 3h17a2 2 0 0 0 1.7-3L13.7 3.9a2 2 0 0 0-3.4 0Z"/></svg><p>If you are in immediate danger, stop reading and call emergency services on <strong>[emergency number]</strong>. If you cannot speak safely, send us a message and we will follow your lead on how and when to respond.</p></div>      </div>

    </div>
  </div>
</section>
